// Formidable Extended Inputs - optional add-on field types for Formidable.
// Concrete field types live next to their views in src/components/Input/<Name>/definition.cnd.
// All types extend fmdbmix:element (owned by formidable-elements) so they are accepted by
// fmdb:fieldList and participate in the standard Formidable rendering and logic contracts.
